 MIPS options:\n\
 --r5900-unsigned32-mask=gnu|sn  select the positive 32-bit mask seed [gnu]\n\
+--r5900-la-addend=gnu|sn  la sym+addend: $gp form or absolute pair [gnu]\n\
 --r5900-sign-bit=signed|unsigned  select the isolated sign-bit seed [signed]\n\
 -membedded-pic		generate embedded position independent code\n\
